a starting point. Your words describe what happens next.\",\"icon\":\"RiFilmLine\"},{\"title\":\"Add sound to the scene\",\"label\":\"Video with sound\",\"description\":\"Want footsteps, rain, or someone speaking? Choose a model that supports sound and include it in your description. Start with a simple scene, then listen to the result to check that the sound fits the action and mood.\",\"icon\":\"RiFlashlightLine\"},{\"title\":\"Try a different look\",\"label\":\"Visual styles\",\"description\":\"Try the same story in Seedance 3.0 as a cartoon, a clay animation, or a movie scene. Describe the look you want, or add an example picture in a mode that supports image references. Compare a few versions to find the right feel.\",\"icon\":\"RiMagicLine\"},{\"title\":\"Change a detail and try again\",\"label\":\"Changes and edits\",\"description\":\"Is the background too dark, or the action not quite right? Change your description and make another version. To work on an existing clip, choose a model with video editing, upload the video, and explain what you want to change.\",\"icon\":\"RiEditLine\"},{\"title\":\"Choose a size and save\",\"label\":\"Size and download\",\"description\":\"Choose a tall video for a phone screen or a wide one for a larger scene. Check your model’s length and quality options before you start. When the video is ready, preview it and download the version you like.\",\"icon\":\"RiLockLine\"}],\"label\":\"Features\"}}]\n"]) self.__next_f.push([1,"21:[\"$\",\"$L28\",null,{\"section\":{\"name\":\"target-users\",\"title\":\"Who is Seedance 3.0 for?\",\"description\":\"Start with a small idea, whether you need a video for work or just want to try something fun. Here are a few ways to use it.\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Content creators\",\"label\":\"Short videos and social posts\",\"description\":\"Turn a fresh idea into your next post with Seedance 3.0. Try a travel scene, a pet story, or an opening clip for your channel. Make one short video first, then decide whether to build more posts around the idea.\",\"icon\":\"RiUserStarLine\"},{\"title\":\"Marketing teams\",\"label\":\"Ad ideas\",\"description\":\"Try a few openings and backgrounds for the same product. Make short versions so your team can compare the scenes and messages. Choose a direction together before working on the details of the ad you plan to run.\",\"icon\":\"RiMegaphoneLine\"},{\"title\":\"Shop owners\",\"label\":\"Product videos\",\"description\":\"Start with photos you already have and create a product video in Seedance 3.0. Show your product on a desk, in a room, or outdoors. Before you post, check its shape, colors, and logo so the video gives shoppers the right idea about what you sell.\",\"icon\":\"RiStore2Line\"},{\"title\":\"Designers and studios\",\"label\":\"Creative drafts\",\"description\":\"Make a moving draft in Seedance 3.0 to discuss with a client. Use a short scene to show the colors, mood, and camera direction you have in mind. Before a full shoot or production, check that everyone is picturing the same thing.\",\"icon\":\"RiBriefcaseLine\"},{\"title\":\"Teachers and trainers\",\"label\":\"Classroom stories\",\"description\":\"Show a simple scene, like a seed growing or rain falling, to introduce a lesson. Use the clip to ask a question and explain the idea behind it. Check the content first so it supports what you are teaching.\",\"icon\":\"RiGraduationCapLine\"},{\"title\":\"Anyone with an idea\",\"label\":\"Fun and personal projects\",\"description\":\"Make a birthday greeting, animate an animal you drew, or create a clip from a bedtime story. You do not need a complete plan to begin. Start with one sentence, watch the result, and add more details as you go.\",\"icon\":\"RiHeartLine\"}]}}]\n"]) self.__next_f.push([1,"22:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"section\":{\"title\":\"Get started with Seedance 3.0 in 3 steps\",\"description\":\"All you need to begin is an idea. Try one simple scene first, then explore more as you learn.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"1. Describe your idea\",\"description\":\"Describe your idea in Seedance 3.0: who is there, where they are, and what happens. Add a reference picture if you want a certain character or product. Use a clear image with a subject that is easy to see.\",\"icon\":\"RiEditLine\"},{\"title\":\"2. Choose settings and generate\",\"description\":\"In Seedance 3.0, pick a model, video length, and shape. Check the credit cost, then click Generate. The options depend on your model, so use the settings shown in the panel.\",\"icon\":\"RiSparklingLine\"},{\"title\":\"3. Watch and download\",\"description\":\"Check the movement, picture, and sound. Download the video if you like it, or change your description and try again. You can also find past work in your Seedance 3.0 generation history.\",\"icon\":\"RiShareLine\"}]}}]\n"]) self.__next_f.push([1,"23:[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"section\":{\"name\":\"testimonial\",\"title\":\"What People Say About Seedance 3.0\",\"description\":\"Creators, shop owners, and teams share their video-making experiences.\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Hannah Larsson\",\"label\":\"YouTube travel creator\",\"description\":\"I added ten photos from my trip and one song.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Hannah Larsson, YouTube travel creator\"}},{\"title\":\"Ravi Menon\",\"label\":\"Indie game developer\",\"description\":\"I used Seedance 3.0 to make a trailer for my game before the art was done.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492562080023-ab3db95bfbce?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Ravi Menon, Indie game developer\"}},{\"title\":\"Claire Dubois\",\"label\":\"Skincare brand owner\",\"description\":\"Our bottle has a tiny logo that other tools always got wrong. Seedance 3.0 kept it sharp and correct.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508214751196-bcfd4ca60f91?w=96\u