61329-78bef0414d7c?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Emily Carter, High school science teacher\"}},{\"title\":\"Tom Reilly\",\"label\":\"Coffee shop owner\",\"description\":\"I took three photos of our latte and asked Seedance 3.0 for a cozy morning ad. The steam, the cup, the sound of the shop, all there.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552058544-f2b08422138a?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Tom Reilly, Coffee shop owner\"}},{\"title\":\"Leila Haddad\",\"label\":\"Fashion designer\",\"description\":\"I uploaded my new dress from the front and back. Seedance 3.0 showed a model walking in it with the right fabric and color.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567532939604-b6b5b0db2604?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Leila Haddad, Fashion designer\"}},{\"title\":\"Owen Fischer\",\"label\":\"Podcast host\",\"description\":\"I needed visuals for my podcast clips. I gave Seedance 3.0 my voice track and a few pictures.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568602471122-7832951cc4c5?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Owen Fischer, Podcast host\"}},{\"title\":\"Priya Nair\",\"label\":\"Wedding planner\",\"description\":\"I show couples a short mood video of their wedding theme before the big day. Seedance 3.0 makes it simple, and couples say yes faster.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607746882042-944635dfe10e?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Priya Nair, Wedding planner\"}},{\"title\":\"Isabella Rossi\",\"label\":\"Small agency founder\",\"description\":\"We now pitch with moving drafts made in Seedance 3.0. Clients understand the idea in ten seconds.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488426862026-3ee34a7d66df?w=96\u0026h=96\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=faces\",\"alt\":\"Isabella Rossi, Small agency founder\"}}]}}]\n"]) self.__next_f.push([1,"24:[